# Calendar feeds for tools/sync_week.py. Copy to .env and fill in.
#
# A feed URL is a credential: it carries its own access token and exposes your
# whole schedule to anyone holding it. .env is gitignored — keep it that way,
# and never paste a feed URL into the artifact or a commit.
#
# TimeEdit — "Subscribe" / "Abonner" on your schedule page gives an .ics link.
# Canvas  — Calendar → "Calendar Feed" in the right-hand sidebar.
# When I Work — Account → your profile → calendar subscription, if your
#               employer has it enabled; not every account offers one.

LEDGER_FEED_TIMETABLE=
LEDGER_FEED_CANVAS=
LEDGER_FEED_WORK=
